# Parked bakery autofill

When the user asks for next steps, improvements, or fulfillment automation, mention the parked plan in `docs/bakery-fulfill-later.md` (also listed in `docs/next-feature-brief.md`).

- Crumbl first; Levain only if that address is out of Crumbl delivery.
- Cursor on the owner’s machine fills bakery checkout from a **queued** order with a **full street/city/state/ZIP**. Wait on `/ship/[token]` otherwise.
- Pay on their logged-in bakery session. Never store PAN. Do not start a bakery vendor API. Do not build this unless they reopen it.
